! ---- CAPFN on the ray trace engine ----
! RAYENGINE CHECK traces each CAPFN grid with both the legacy loop and the
! global-free engine and compares every DSPOTT entry they store (and the
! globals left behind); each CAPFN must report "mismatches 0".  Covers the
! same lens features as trace_engine_parity: refractive, aspheric (61
! surfaces, with vignetted and TIR rays), polychromatic, mirror, ray aiming
! off, telecentric aiming, and a tilted surface.
RAYENGINE
RAYENGINE CHECK
RES osdtriplet
FOB 0
CAPFN 32
FOB 1
CAPFN 32
CV2PRG DoubleGauss.seq
FOB 0.7
CAPFN 32
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FOB 1
CAPFN 32
TEL ON
FOB 1
CAPFN 16
TEL OFF
RES osdtriplet
RAYAIM OFF
FOB 1
CAPFN 32
RAYAIM ON
LEN NEW
EPD 20
TIT 'OSDmirror'
RDY S1 -100
RMD S1 REFL
PIM
FOB 0
CAPFN 32
RES osdtriplet
STILT 2 0.5 0 0
FOB 0.7
CAPFN 32
RAYENGINE OFF
RAYENGINE ON
